      "t": "Welcome to Kukhnya, the Russian comedy set in Claude Monet, a smart Moscow restaurant where Chef Barinov rules the kitchen. Today a fire inspector arrives and finds fault with everything he sees, while Vika, the art director, tries to keep her cool. Listen first to how polite he stays while he complains.",
